title: "Awesome Auditable AI"
abstract: "A curated list of papers, tools, datasets, benchmarks, and standards for auditing AI agents, covering the reliability engineering that auditability depends on: monitoring, robustness, fault tolerance, and failure attribution, alongside decision records and post-hoc review."
